            <KeyedObject objectId="0:769"><KeyedProperty property="drawTargetId"><KeyFrameId value="0:770" frame="0"/></KeyedProperty></KeyedObject> <!-- Arm Right Depth: in front -->
            <KeyedObject objectId="0:130"> <!-- Arm Left (on screen, the arm toward the content): the wave, drawn behind the head and the ears (Arm Left Depth). The fist rises on one curve, up behind the head's lower corner and the ear, and comes out above the ear with the forearm showing, so the arm never crosses the ear's face; it waves there and comes back down the same curve over 300 ms (frames 52 to 70), evenly eased along the fist's path so no step whips, the arm lengthening only as it rises (keyed every other frame along the curve) -->
