        <!-- Celebration, small (intensity 0): a jump, the arms up, a few sparks, a big grin and smiling eyes.
             Both arms are drawn behind the head and the ears (Arm Left Depth, Arm Right Depth)
             and run Greeting's raise curve: up behind the head's lower corners and the ears,
             out above the ears with the forearms showing, and back down the same curve as Pip
             falls and lands (frames 42 to 66), the arm shortening as it lowers. So no fist ever
             paints over an ear's face or the head's, and no frame shows a long arm (pip:build
             checks). The arm's turn, the hand's reach and the upper arm's stretch are keyed
             every other frame along that curve. -->
        <LinearAnimation duration="84" name="Celebration Small" id="0:323">
